{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309380","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130938001:1":{"text":"네. 조금 전에 다른 부족과 연락이 닿았어요. 폭주하던 동물들이 정상으로 돌아왔다고 소식을 보내왔지 뭐예요.","source_cn":"是啊。我们刚和其他聚落取得联系，部落里就传来了好消息，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA077D6F1419C31B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130938002:1":{"text":"그래서 저희도 지금 집으로 돌아가는 길인데, 오라큘라가 너무 꾸물거리네요!","source_cn":"我们正在踏上回家的路途！不过奥奎拉还是慢吞吞的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03488CF8FB0E017B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130938003:1":{"text":"어휴, 뭐... 그래도 부족의 위험이 해결되었으니, 재촉하지 않으려고요.","source_cn":"算了，既然部落里的危机解除了，我也就不催她了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682D0FF77A76E747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血塔比提":{"text":"타비티","source":"蛮血塔比提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}